<title>USA: Hearings set on Orange &amp; Rockland settlement.</title>
<headline>Hearings set on Orange &amp; Rockland settlement.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York State Public Service Commission said Tuesday it has scheduled a series of open consumer education forums and public statement hearings to seek consumer views on an electric rate and restructuring settlement proposal filed by Orange and Rockland Utilities Inc.</p>
<p>The hearings begin at 1430 EDT/1830 GMT and 1930 EDT/2330 GMT May 14 at Goshen, N.Y., and Port Jervis, N.Y., respectively; and at 1930 EDT May 15 in New City, N.Y., the commission said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
